    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your chicken has been taken. They will pay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were just a &quot;simple farmer&quot;, until monsters raided your land and took your last companion: your chicken. Now, fueled by fury and a surprising knack for combat, you\u2019ll journey across a wild and dangerous world to bring your feathery friend home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infuse Weapons with Elemental Power</strong><br>Master the elements and channel fire, water, and more into your weapons, or even your fists! Switch and combine elements and weapons to discover powerful synergies and combat strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Hordes, Fast-Paced Combat</strong><br>Enemies don\u2019t play fair. Dodge, counter, and unleash devastating attacks against chaotic, ever-changing enemy formations that keep every encounter fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse with Style</strong><br>Leap over rooftops, wall-jump through ruins, and chain together parkour moves in fluid motion. Movement is your greatest weapon, and your only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unlikely Quest, A Relentless Farmer</strong><br>This isn\u2019t just about a chicken. It\u2019s about heart, grit, and a man who refuses to give up. Uncover secrets, upgrade your skills, and push forward, one punch at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your chicken has been taken. They will pay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were just a &quot;simple farmer&quot;, until monsters raided your land and took your last companion: your chicken. Now, fueled by fury and a surprising knack for combat, you\u2019ll journey across a wild and dangerous world to bring your feathery friend home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infuse Weapons with Elemental Power</strong><br>Master the elements and channel fire, water, and more into your weapons, or even your fists! Switch and combine elements and weapons to discover powerful synergies and combat strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Hordes, Fast-Paced Combat</strong><br>Enemies don\u2019t play fair. Dodge, counter, and unleash devastating attacks against chaotic, ever-changing enemy formations that keep every encounter fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse with Style</strong><br>Leap over rooftops, wall-jump through ruins, and chain together parkour moves in fluid motion. Movement is your greatest weapon, and your only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unlikely Quest, A Relentless Farmer</strong><br>This isn\u2019t just about a chicken. It\u2019s about heart, grit, and a man who refuses to give up. Uncover secrets, upgrade your skills, and push forward, one punch at a time.</p>",
